0018: GI server prototype (real-time GI work package R-03). Client exports RemixBridge_GiOpen, RemixBridge_GiSolve, RemixBridge_GiPoll, RemixBridge_GiCancel and RemixBridge_GiReadCounters (client.giServer, default off). On the first open the server starts a worker thread with its own Vulkan device on DXVK's GPU (matched by deviceUUID through DXVK's interop interface; ray query and acceleration structures enabled when present). A solve runs one compute pass into the worker's host-visible buffer; the play thread copies finished results into the named DEFAULT-pool texture through a SYSTEMMEM staging texture and UpdateSurface, at Present and every 64 commands, at most server.giUploadBudgetKB (1024) a pass, then publishes the ticket in a shared answer slot. Reset, ResetEx and device destroy answer open tickets D3DERR_DEVICELOST. Test: test-gi.cmd (test_gi_device). Needs Vulkan-Headers, volk and glslang in submodules\ (build.cmd fetches them).
Applies after 0001-0014 and 0017 on NVIDIAGameWorks/dxvk-remix f35b86a (bridge/ only), with or without 0015-0016.
